    "id": "2086472658145645027",
    "text": "setting up hermes inside buzz by hand is fiddly. someone turned the whole thing into a skill you just hand to your agent.\n\nit's called buzz-skills. drop it in and your remote hermes handles its own buzz setup:\n\n- hermes-in-buzz: installs the buzz cli, sorts auth, and connects your gateway to a buzz community\n- buzz-media-attachments: teaches the agent to send video and media as native buzz attachments\n- buzz-self-hosting: walks you through standing up your own relay\n\ninstead of following every step yourself, you hand the skill to hermes and it configures itself.\n\ni wrote the full manual walkthrough of the hermes-in-buzz setup in the guide below, this is the shortcut once you understand what it's doing.",
